Package: com.qwq.blelogger
Name: BLE Logger
Version: 1.3.1
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: 不注入 App 的 BLE 指令记录器：插件自己连设备，帧显示在设置面板
 只注入 SpringBoard。填目标设备名后自动扫描、连接、订阅所有 Notify 特征，
 设备推上来的每一帧记到 /var/mobile/Library/Preferences/com.qwq.blelogger.capture.plist。
 设置 -> BLE Logger 里可看运行状态、最近 15 条帧，点按复制单条或全部。
 目标设备没有配套 App 也能用。
Maintainer: 777qwq
Author: 777qwq
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate, preferenceloader
